{"id": "DdbYNbdIP2e", "title": "Video by adilet.fndr", "description": "Your vibe-coded app can get sued for $100,000 before it makes a single sale.\n\nNot a percent of revenue. Per visitor. Per session. Per email.\n\n🎂 no age question on signup → $53,000 per kid (COPPA)\n🔤 Google Fonts loaded from Google → €100 per visitor (Munich court, 2022)\n⏺️ session replay on by default → $5,000 per session (California wiretapping)\n✉️ launch email with no unsubscribe / no address → $53,000 per email (CAN-SPAM)\n💳 Stripe subscription with no renewal terms next to the button → every renewal is a gift you refund (California ARL)\n🖼️ never registered the $6 DMCA agent → $150,000 per stolen image\n\nThat’s how zero sales turns into a hundred grand.\n\nThe fix is one prompt. Send this video’s link to Claude and ask it to fix everything — or paste this:\n\n“Audit my app for legal exposure and fix every issue: add an age gate to signup (COPPA), self-host all fonts instead of loading from Google, turn session replay off by default and mask inputs, add an unsubscribe link and physical address to every marketing email, show renewal terms and cancel instructions next to the subscribe button, and register a DMCA designated agent. List each change and the file it touched.”\n\nFollowing me is the cheapest cofounder you’ll ever hire. 🤝\n\n#claude #ai #vibecoding", "channel": "adilet.fndr", "uploader_id": "26455618998", "uploader": "Adilet", "timestamp": 1789732725, "like_count": 21542, "comment_count": 2881, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1683211879905188a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.989, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "